            "caption": "Notify Host Ntfy: Token",
            "description": "ntfy access token. Required for topics that are reserved or protected by an access control list. Passed here, the token is visible to every user on this host for as long as the plugin runs, because a command-line argument shows up in the process list; prefer --token-file.",
